{"title":"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the squares of the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/4652f5234b0eb031c14d8e490a7ab04c6a45174b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2hx=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The absolute value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0dbd3e07311893c166d1c7b26025bd4d4628941.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }-1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\textstyle\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\textstyle\\frac{3}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"468\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite the equation as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d802b4fb379cf51dfac6755dfcff77b88b0a38f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + 2hx - 3 = 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" /> By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1de45bf1df9468a31ebec3db8c141da3be85a03b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2h$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> and the product of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83d6ee5347c129ff624506d39ba9a23f72c82f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3.$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Let the two roots be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09d9c01a214955f96b174391be96b26abf545cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" /> Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b99eba5478869ca6bcde048172e6a2fe4367680d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^2 + s^2 = (r+s)^2 - 2rs = (-2h)^2 -2(-3)\\]\" width=\"334\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5863152376cf623d74c7f65d3f74917722aed7b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4h^2 + 6 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/e/15ea1d0a736ce074b821f4ed8d6bc306190fdb54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = \\pm 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> This doesn't match any of the answer choices, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/68416f856bbd1505d60c18517a019492c1e6f44c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }\\text{None of these}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"151\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The given equation can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/5/115dded7087cb9831348cbafd8e1495ef04c4737.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2hx-3=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, we know that the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1de45bf1df9468a31ebec3db8c141da3be85a03b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2h$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />. Thus, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Newton%27s_Sums\" title=\"Newton&#39;s Sums\">Newton's sums</a>, we have the following equation:\n\\begin{align*}\n10+(2h)(-2h)+2(-3) &amp;= 0 \\\\\n10-4h^2-6 &amp;= 0 \\\\\n-4h^2 &amp;= -4 \\\\\nh^2 &amp;= 1 \\\\\n|h| &amp;= 1 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\nThus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/4/954711e07c2480857cece4a1be1191c52b33fa75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }\\text{None of these}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"146\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME\" title=\"1971 AHSME\">1971 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1971 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1971\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" c